el_GR-joy-medium: a Greek voice for the Piper text to speech system,
copied unchanged from https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices
(el/el_GR/joy/medium/). Its model card (MODEL_CARD in this folder) names
the dataset and the licence.

Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

You may copy and share the voice and what it speaks for non-commercial
purposes, with credit to its authors (the Piper voices project and the
recordings named in MODEL_CARD) and a link to the licence. Speech made with
this voice may not be sold or used for commercial purposes.

orOS downloads this folder on the person's device only when they ask for
the natural Greek voice, and says the licence where they download it.
Nothing in it was changed.
